      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Rang Undang-Undang Perhubungan Perusahaan (Pindaan) 2007"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 10 seksyen yang berikut: \"No other claims after trade union has made a claim 10A. Where a claim for recognition by a trade union in respect of workmen or a class of workmen has been made under section 9, no other trade union of workmen shall make a claim for recognition under that section or be accorded recognition in respect of the same workmen or class of workmen until the claim is resolved under paragraph 9(3)(a) or deemed to have been withdrawn under subsection 9(4), or decided by the Minister under subsection 9(5).\". Pindaan seksyen 12"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan seksyen 12 dengan seksyen yang berikut: \"12. Where a claim for recognition — (a) has been withdrawn by the trade union of workmen concerned after a report has been made by the trade union of workmen to the Director General under subsection 9(4); or (b) has been decided by the Minister under subsection 9(5), resulting in the trade union of workmen concerned not being accorded recognition, such trade union shall not make any further claim for recognition in respect of the same workmen or class of workmen until six months have elapsed from the date of such withdrawal or decision.\". Pindaan seksyen 13"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 13 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (2) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(2A) A proposal for a collective agreement may provide for one or more of the following: (a) provision for training to enhance skills and knowledge of the workmen; (b) provision for an annual review of the wage system; and (c) provision for a performance-based remuneration system.\". Pemotongan seksyen 15"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memotong seksyen 15. Pindaan seksyen 16"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 16(5) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memotong perkataan \"(2) or\". Pindaan seksyen 19B"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 19B(1) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perenggan (a) dengan perenggan yang berikut: \"(a) an employer who is a party to the trade dispute may — (i) represent himself or be represented by his duly authorized employee; (ii) where he is a member of a trade union of employers, be represented by any officer or employee of such trade union of employers; or (iii) notwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in any written law relating to the registration of trade unions, be represented by any official of an organization of employers registered in Malaysia (not being a trade union of employers); and\". Pindaan seksyen 20"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_16__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_16__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 20 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_16__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_16",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (6) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: \"(6) In any proceedings under subsection (2) — (a) an employer may — (i) represent himself or be represented by his duly authorized employee; (ii) where he is a member of a trade union of employers, be represented by any officer or employee of such trade union of employers; or (iii) notwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in any written law relating to the registration of trade unions, be represented by any official of an organization of employers registered in Malaysia (not being a trade union of employers); and (b) a workman may — (i) represent himself; (ii) where he is a member of a trade union of workmen, be represented by any officer or employee of such trade union of workmen; or (iii) notwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in any written law relating to the registration of trade unions, be represented by any official of an organization of workmen registered in Malaysia (not being a trade union of workmen).\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_16__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_16",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (8) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(9) Where a workman who has made a representation under subsection (1) attends none of the conferences under paragraph (8)(b) without any reasonable excuse, the representation shall be deemed to have been withdrawn.\". Pindaan seksyen 22"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 22(5) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"subsection 20(3)\" perkataan \"or any application for reference to the High Court under subsection 33A(1)\". Pindaan seksyen 23"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 23(4) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"subsection 20(3)\" perkataan \"or any application for reference to the High Court under subsection 33A(1)\". Pindaan seksyen 23A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen23AAktaibudipindadenganmemotong subseksyen (2). Pindaan seksyen 27"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini bolehlah dinamakan Akta Perhubungan Perusahaan (Pindaan) 2007."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini mula berkuat kuasa pada tarikh yang ditetapkan oleh Menteri melalui pemberitahuan dalam Warta, dan Menteri boleh menetapkan tarikh yang berlainan bagi permulaan kuat kuasa peruntukan yang berlainan Akta ini. Pindaan tajuk panjang"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Perhubungan Perusahaan 1967 [Akta 177], yang disebut \"Akta ibu\" dalam Akta ini, dipinda dalam tajuk panjang dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"An Act\" perkataan \"to promote and maintain industrial harmony and\". Pindaan seksyen 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
