        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (f) perenggan yang berikut: \"(fa) provide for the procedures relating to a claim for recognition by a trade union of workmen; and\". Pindaan Jadual"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_33",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "33",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Jadual kepada Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan \"SCHEDULE\" dengan perkataan \"FIRST SCHEDULE\". Jadual baru Kedua"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_34",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "34",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas Jadual Pertama Jadual yang berikut: \"SECOND SCHEDULE FACTORS FOR CONSIDERATION IN MAKING AN AWARD IN RELATION TO A REFERENCE UNDER SUBSECTION 20(3) [Subsection 30(6A)1 1. In the event that backwages are to be given, such backwages shall not exceed twenty-four months' backwages from the date of dismissal based on the last-drawn salary of the person who has been dismissed without just cause or excuse; 2. In the case of a probationer who has been dismissed without just cause or excuse, any backwages given shall not exceed twelve months' backwages from the date of dismissal based on his last-drawn salary; 3. Where there is post-dismissal earnings, a percentage of such earnings, to be decided by the Court, shall be deducted from the backwages given; 4. Any relief given shall not include any compensation for loss of future earnings; and 5. Any relief given shall take into account contributory misconduct of the workman.\". Peruntukan peralihan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_35",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "35",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Semua aduan yang dibuat di bawah seksyen 8, tuntutan pengiktirafan yang dibuat di bawah seksyen 9, representasi bagi diambil kerja semula yang dibuat di bawah seksyen 20 Akta ibu, dan semua prosiding yang dimulakan atau award yang dibuat di Mahkamah Perusahaan yang berhubungan dengan rujukan di bawah subseksyen 20(3) sebelum Akta ini mula berkuat kuasa hendaklah diteruskan dan mempunyai kesan seolah-olah Akta ibu tidak dipinda oleh Akta ini."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
