        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas takrif \"maliciously\" takrif yang berikut: \"Minister\" means the Minister charged with the responsibility for human resources;'. Pindaan seksyen 2A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_4__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_4__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_4__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 2A Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_4__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (2) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: \"(2) The Yang di-Pertuan Agong — (a) shall appoint a Deputy Director General for Industrial Relations; and (b) may appoint such number of Directors of Industrial Relations, Principal Assistant Directors of Industrial Relations, Assistant Directors of Industrial Relations and Industrial Relations Officers as he considers necessary or expedient for the purposes of carrying out and giving effect to the provisions of this Act.\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_4__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (2) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(2A) The persons appointed under subsections (1) and (2) shall be persons from the Industrial Relations Officers Scheme of Service and such appointments shall be published in the Gazette\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_4__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (3) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(4) Subject to such limitations, if any, as may be prescribed, an officer appointed under subsection (2) shall exercise all the powers, discharge all the duties and perform all the functions of the Director General under this Act, and every power so exercised, duty so discharged and function so performed shall be deemed to have been duly exercised, discharged and performed for the purposes of this Act.\". Seksyen baru 2B"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 2A seksyen yang berikut: \"All officers to be public servants 2B. All officers appointed under section 2A shall be deemed to be public servants for the purposes of the Penal Code [Act 574].\". Pindaan seksyen 5"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perenggan 5(2)(b) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"a managerial\" di mana-mana jua terdapat perkataan \", an executive or a security\". Pindaan seksyen 8"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 8 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(1A) Where a complaint in subsection (1) relates to the dismissal of a workman, the provisions of section 20 shall apply to the exclusion of subsections 8(2) to 8(4).\". Pindaan seksyen 9"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_f",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_h",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_j"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 9 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1A) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(1B) The Director General, upon receipt of a reference under subsection (1A), may take such steps or make such enquiries as he may consider necessary or expedient to resolve the matter. (lc) Where the matter is not resolved under subsection (1B) the Director General shall notify the Minister. (ID) Upon receipt of the notification under subsection (lc), the Minister shall give his decision as to whether any workman or workmen are employed in a managerial, executive, confidential or security capacity and communicate in writing the decision to the trade union of workmen, to the employer and to the trade union of employers concerned.\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (2), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"A trade union\" dengan perkataan \"Subject to subsection (1), a trade union\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_c__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_c__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (3) —"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_c__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (b), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"; or\" dengan noktah; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_c__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong perenggan (c);"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (3), subseksyen yang berikut: \"(3A) Upon according recognition to the trade union of workmen concerned under paragraph (3)(a), employer or the trade union of employers concerned shall notify the Director General.\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (4) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: \"(4) Where the trade union of workmen concerned receives a notification under paragraph (3)(b), or where the employer or trade union of employers concerned fails to comply with subsection (3), the trade union of workmen may, within fourteen days — (a) of the receipt of the notification; or (b) after the twenty-one day period in subsection (3) has lapsed, report the matter in writing to the Director General, failing which the claim for recognition shall be deemed to have been withdrawn.\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_f",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "f",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (4A) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: \"(4A) Upon receipt of a report under subsection (4), the Director General may take such steps or make such enquiries to ascertained the competence of the trade union of workmen concerned to represent any workmen or class of workmen in respect of whom the recognition is sought to be accorded; and (b) by way of secret ballot, the percentage of the workmen or class of workmen, in respect of whom recognition is being sought, who are members of the trade union of workmen making the claim.\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "g",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_iii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_iv"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (4B) —"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"under subsection\" perkataan \"(1B) or\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_ii__subpara_A",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_ii__subpara_B"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (a) —"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_ii__subpara_A",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "A",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_ii",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"necessary or relevant\" perkataan \"within the period specified in the requirement\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_ii__subpara_B",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "B",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_ii",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong perkataan \"and\" di hujung perenggan itu;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_iii__subpara_A",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_iii__subpara_B"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (b) —"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_iii__subpara_A",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "A",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_iii",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan \"for his decision any question on\" dengan perkataan \"for him to ascertain\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_iii__subpara_B",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "B",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_iii",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan noktah dengan perkataan \"; and\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g__subpara_iv",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iv",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_g",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (b) perenggan yang berikut: \"(c) may enter any place of employment where any workmen in respect of whom a claim for recognition is sought to be accorded are being employed to examine any records or documents or to conduct secret ballot.\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_h",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "h",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (4c) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: \"(4c) Upon ascertaining the matter under subsection (4A), the Director General shall notify the Minister.\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_i",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (5), dengan memotong perkataan \"; a decision of the Minister under this subsection may include a decision as to who are workmen employed in a managerial, executive, confidential or security capacity\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8__para_j",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "j",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (6), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"under subsection\" perkataan \"(ID) or\". Pindaan seksyen 10"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_9__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_9__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_9__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 10(2) Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_9__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (a), dengan memotong perkataan \"or\" di hujung perenggan itu;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_9__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perenggan (b) dengan perenggan yang berikut: \"(b) where the claim for recognition is deemed to have been withdrawn under subsection 9(4) or has been decided by the Minister under subsection 9(5); or\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_9__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/32/msa@/~cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (b) perenggan yang berikut: \"(c) where a termination is due to retirement, expiry of a fixed term contract, non-confirmation of a probationer or being medically boarded out.\". Seksyen baru 10A"
      }
    }
  ]
}
